{"availability":"available","full":"PedroDnT/SILO-BZ","name":"SILO-BZ","description":"Brazilian public financial data, ingested daily and served to people and AI agents","category":"Finance","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-02-25T04:42:10Z","updated":"2026-10-06T16:30:04Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://silo-bz-deloslabs.vercel.app/","topics":["api","brazi","brazil-finance-data","brazil-open-data","finance","finance-api","finance-dashboard"],"demo":"https://silo-bz-deloslabs.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T16:30:09.573Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T16:30:09.573Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T16:30:09.573Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:17:53.464Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-06T16:30:09.573Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["SILO is a production system. A GitHub Actions cron pulls the day's filings from CVM, BACEN, IBGE and B3, validates them, upserts them into one Supabase Postgres warehouse, rebuilds the analytical layer and republishes the public dashboard. It keeps a verifiable record of funds, listed companies and markets, for researchers, AI agents and anyone checking a claim against what was actually filed.","It is built for financial accountability, not for choosing investments: there is no advice, rating or recommendation anywhere in it. A failed fetch raises, a field the source did not publish stays blank, and an unknown identifier returns nothing rather than a plausible number."],"features":["No ingest API. The pipeline writes via GitHub Actions and the CLI; callers read schema api. The old localhost ingest Flask (app.py, src/api/) is deleted.","No fabricated quotes. The old b3calcapi stays deleted. Quotes come from B3's public COTAHIST zips; an unknown ticker returns an empty result, never a guessed close.","No local Postgres, Docker or Alembic. Supabase Postgres is the single source of truth.","No Solana oracle. The Delos Oracle experiment is out of scope."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/PedroDnT/SILO-BZ/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"80b1caca366bb2445dcf5a269e01c422d54812ed01daea04c29a339693c1d187","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T06:51:39.260Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:17:53.587Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"SILO is a production system. A GitHub Actions cron pulls the day's filings from CVM, BACEN, IBGE and B3, validates them, upserts them into one Supabase Postgres warehouse, rebuilds the analytical layer and republishes the public dashboard. It keeps a verifiable record of funds, listed companies and markets, for researchers, AI agents and anyone checking a claim against what was actually filed.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/PedroDnT/SILO-BZ/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"It is built for financial accountability, not for choosing investments: there is no advice, rating or recommendation anywhere in it. A failed fetch raises, a field the source did not publish stays blank, and an unknown identifier returns nothing rather than a plausible number.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/PedroDnT/SILO-BZ/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Sign-in (GitHub OAuth, /signin.html) raises the caps and the query budget for a token holder.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/PedroDnT/SILO-BZ/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"80b1caca366bb2445dcf5a269e01c422d54812ed01daea04c29a339693c1d187","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/PedroDnT/SILO-BZ/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T08:17:53.587Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-04T07:14:29Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/PedroDnT/SILO-BZ/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T08:17:53.588Z","hash":"80b1caca366bb2445dcf5a269e01c422d54812ed01daea04c29a339693c1d187","originalBytes":16889,"storedBytes":16889,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["docs","daily","api","dashboard","planni